# scry-on-turn over the middle and the far end of its range: Bot1 wears "scry 2 on your second turn" and "scry 1 on your
# sixth turn". On turn 3 (its second) it scries 2 and bottoms both Islands, drawing a Forest; on turns 5 to 9 nothing; on
# turn 11 (its sixth) it scries 1 and bottoms the Mountain then on top, drawing a Forest again.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest x7
Island x2
Forest x4
Mountain
Forest x26

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x40

[Variant]
Bot1: maximum 20; emblem Gear test: scry-on-turn, turn 2, count 2; emblem Gear test: scry-on-turn, turn 6, count 1
Bot2: maximum 20

[Actions]
[T3 Bot1.Upkeep]
? Stack = Gear test: scry-on-turn, turn 2, count 2
Bot1.Arrange(| Island; Island)
[T5 Bot1.Upkeep]
? Stack.Count = 0
[T9 Bot1.Upkeep]
? Stack.Count = 0
[T11 Bot1.Upkeep]
? Stack = Gear test: scry-on-turn, turn 6, count 1
Bot1.Arrange(| Mountain)
[T11 Bot1.Main1]

[Expect]
Bot1.Hand = Forest; Forest; Forest; Forest; Forest; Forest; Forest; Forest; Forest; Forest; Forest; Forest
